Project fingerprint
-------------------
Both apps carry the same open authorship constants (app/linc/android/Provenance.kt and
Linc.Desktop/Provenance.cs). The project fingerprint is the SHA-256 of the UTF-8 sentence
"Linc by deloweProjects — https://github.com/deloweProjects/Linc":

    93b660d11f6717cfe67f72a92881210977685b4954a673cadf67e2e11358f281

Anyone can check it:

    printf '%s' 'Linc by deloweProjects — https://github.com/deloweProjects/Linc' | sha256sum

It is informational only. Nothing in Linc verifies it, enforces it or sends it anywhere, and Linc
works the same without it. The apps show the author's name and this link in their own logs, and
the handshake between the phone and the PC carries only the author's name.

